Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_videoout.c | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_videoout.c b/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_videoout.c
